OL,3,GNEWSAPolice investigating hoax threat
OL,4,Aemails sent to Scottish schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe messages are believed to have been
OL,7,Fsent to both primary and secondary
OL,8,Fschools in more than 10 different
OL,9,Fcouncil areas.
